# eSCORE frontend (Vite) — build paytida bundlega yoziladigan o'zgaruvchilar.
# DIQQAT: VITE_* qiymatlari brauzerga ochiq — bu yerga hech qachon secret yozmang.
# Lokal: `.env.local` ga nusxalang (git'ga tushmaydi). Render'da render.yaml → escore-web envVars.

# Node backend manzili (oxirida `/` siz). Dev'da bo'sh bo'lsa http://localhost:4500.
# Production build'da MAJBURIY — bo'lmasa ilova aniq xato ko'rsatadi.
# Production: https://escore-backend.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4500

# Sayt manzili: canonical va og:url uchun. Bo'sh bo'lsa joriy origin (window.location.origin).
# Production: https://escore-web.onrender.com (domen ulangach https://sizningdomen.uz)
VITE_SITE_URL=http://localhost:5190
